{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>衞生巾是不少女性的必需品，其吸收能力亦是消費者關注的重點之一。消委會測試市面上36款有翼衞生巾，發現不同樣本的吸收速度表現參差，介乎3秒至73秒。其中每片約3.17元、來自內地LadiM的石墨烯衞生巾日用，吸收速度達73秒，整體評分僅3分，表現最不理想。</p><p>至於最便宜的一款是來自韓國Kleannara有機純棉衞生巾，一包16片會員價16.1元，即每片約1.01元，吸收速度為10秒，整體評分達5分滿分，是性價比最高一款。</p><figure><img alt=\"消委會測試市面上36款有翼衞生巾，發現不同樣本的吸收速度表現參差，介乎3秒至73秒。（任葆穎攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176104473299259392498561.jpeg/hKjL8JfWFdBjkLQWQmnl0IQKKKMgEpulONsWWh3bFlo\"/><figcaption>消委會測試市面上36款有翼衞生巾，發現不同樣本的吸收速度表現參差，介乎3秒至73秒。（任葆穎攝）</figcaption></figure><p>消委會測試市面上36款有翼衞生巾，並根據其聲稱長度分4組，包括22厘米至25厘米；26厘米至29厘米；30厘米至35厘米；40厘米至43厘米；消委會發現其吸收速度介乎表現參差，介乎3秒至73秒。</p><figure><img alt=\"Mannings Guardian清新抑菌超薄日用衛生巾 Fresh Antibacterial Ultra Thin Napkin 24cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114524575502336830269.jpeg/Mj9xyykQ6EqXEz4psLddQeA3Q--FhSbS_Tk1p_05Nac\"/><figcaption>Mannings Guardian清新抑菌超薄日用衛生巾 Fresh Antibacterial Ultra Thin Napkin 24cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日綿織物Nichimen Orimono100%有機純棉昼用衛生巾24cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114527482286080352146.jpeg/bheJrsohzT3PSmimCwKIFUheX5ody4Scp8qS96fKkvc\"/><figcaption>日綿織物Nichimen Orimono100%有機純棉昼用衛生巾24cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高潔絲KotexWhite唯白纖巧護翼日用衞生巾23cm-3D超爽圈 (優惠孖裝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114530456178688635987.jpeg/Gmw3UObgQIEeFYeGMxSJcMgidDxYA5ul5eVgWeXlYFk\"/><figcaption>高潔絲KotexWhite唯白纖巧護翼日用衞生巾23cm-3D超爽圈 (優惠孖裝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樂而雅Laurier抑菌清新絲薄日用衞生巾22.5cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114533249716224381756.jpeg/cQtXWmZjn2grdO3afOGL2s1fhxp2yBlgRfaUXUX2lF0\"/><figcaption>樂而雅Laurier抑菌清新絲薄日用衞生巾22.5cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樂而雅Laurier零感特薄Feather Touch特長日用絲薄衞生巾 25cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114536127139840261538.jpeg/cY5_uGr3e_Lr4ImdccuBFRIYAVzg7H76fickBH4nJAQ\"/><figcaption>樂而雅Laurier零感特薄Feather Touch特長日用絲薄衞生巾 25cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Elis極致輕薄日夜用衛生棉23cm(有護翼) Ultra Light Sanitary Napkin 23cm (with wings)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114528761417728698425.jpeg/-tGq9gR819URZSF-0ijEZ_oEZ7E0muRZAap_BwGqfwc\"/><figcaption>Elis極致輕薄日夜用衛生棉23cm(有護翼) Ultra Light Sanitary Napkin 23cm (with wings)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇菲SofyCenter-in口袋便攜衛生巾纖薄護翼特長日用 24.5cm甜美花香\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114531466874880345091.jpeg/Gcr_fxjaOvAg4qCeM0zeeSmOJd2TDFGrwAUlm8AFJZs\"/><figcaption>蘇菲SofyCenter-in口袋便攜衛生巾纖薄護翼特長日用 24.5cm甜美花香</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇菲Sofy 100%有機棉衛生巾護翼日用23cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114534625316864918640.jpeg/wkJlaaLJw4-ns_nPyMHyqILaU2xaAwRA8b6FuvG-hbo\"/><figcaption>蘇菲Sofy 100%有機棉衛生巾護翼日用23cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"護舒寶WhisperAir-Dry Fresh 草本健康衞生巾24cm (2包超值組)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114537540489216854903.jpeg/kaWat1887zZZ2wH8r_FXHd1rUY_0FI3PqDGneqgxp3o\"/><figcaption>護舒寶WhisperAir-Dry Fresh 草本健康衞生巾24cm (2包超值組)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高潔絲KotexWhite唯白纖巧護翼日用衞生巾23cm-3D超爽圈 (優惠孖裝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114540543741952325087.jpeg/6UZZlBQJ4gP9-MoQUdTnXGFbaCoagof6IglqDCIJagw\"/><figcaption>高潔絲KotexWhite唯白纖巧護翼日用衞生巾23cm-3D超爽圈 (優惠孖裝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樂護絲WomenXPad-Pro衛生巾日用 Pad -Pro Sanitary Pad\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114526576185344928674.jpeg/ApTWHPuvlnh90GuB_96YDSIg4l1OklF2LjZv9C42b_Q\"/><figcaption>樂護絲WomenXPad-Pro衛生巾日用 Pad -Pro Sanitary Pad</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"LadiM石墨烯衞生巾日用 Far Infrared Graphene Antibacterial Day Use Sanitary Napkin 24.5cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114529701072896051347.jpeg/reWSUXjh4v8Nb0HNV5Uupr1I2pfO8ba95cbkTOXG5Ew\"/><figcaption>LadiM石墨烯衞生巾日用 Far Infrared Graphene Antibacterial Day Use Sanitary Napkin 24.5cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇菲Sofy 舒適安睡衞生巾 Sleep Tight (42cm)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114532712714240091532.jpeg/yJUZ9NfhIzZuOgXTG1OndHejIm3Fjm7JheLQAIXi0AA\"/><figcaption>蘇菲Sofy 舒適安睡衞生巾 Sleep Tight (42cm)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樂而雅Laurier 安睡倍護夜用纖巧 3D防漏邊衞生巾40cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114535539806208219856.jpeg/81GgbwR6zh1qfWwqkAW8rakGeqvBfSMTRAEFikQBBYo\"/><figcaption>樂而雅Laurier 安睡倍護夜用纖巧 3D防漏邊衞生巾40cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇菲Sofy 超熟睡密着安心夜用極厚衞生巾420\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114538538864640217348.jpeg/lCf0Y-TnW8o2I_gmGZjX4L8pW8yhj1hDp-G4VKfhuFQ\"/><figcaption>蘇菲Sofy 超熟睡密着安心夜用極厚衞生巾420</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高潔絲Kotex 安心熟睡超薄熟睡夜用衞生巾41cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114522553847808051438.jpeg/rt47BgxidW_WgUWm78-0_VFCUXjeLgkNxCl7zsQpe84\"/><figcaption>高潔絲Kotex 安心熟睡超薄熟睡夜用衞生巾41cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Dear Skin Air Embo特長夜用衛生巾—無化學吸水物料 Air  Embo Sanitary Pad Superlong Overnight 43cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114525448048640754320.jpeg/HhmOZ0epHpaBim0E3P-ck6SofqOfsOAa9xXlK_cV5Ss\"/><figcaption>Dear Skin Air Embo特長夜用衛生巾—無化學吸水物料 Air  Embo Sanitary Pad Superlong Overnight 43cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"護舒寶Whisper 熊抱安睡425mm超吸透氣升級防漏超安睡量多夜用衞生巾 (7片X2包)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114528321277952026179.jpeg/1cKYJaR2bR0IXqar57eYO8-rpLgRMq7J1wbL2dcGy9k\"/><figcaption>護舒寶Whisper 熊抱安睡425mm超吸透氣升級防漏超安睡量多夜用衞生巾 (7片X2包)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Elis Luna Fit 零感親膚特薄日夜用衞生棉32.5cm (有護翼)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114531228061696857412.jpeg/2DRJjDPoVGi6izUIeMRVZwqOVLTwcL8OQB35S0Ad-Us\"/><figcaption>Elis Luna Fit 零感親膚特薄日夜用衞生棉32.5cm (有護翼)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇菲Sofy Sports動感防漏纖薄護翼夜用衞生巾30cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114534319394816586403.jpeg/lRuuwQf6NQkb7rEMnyLGuvDdQTDjw7LeKKeYXSinmF0\"/><figcaption>蘇菲Sofy Sports動感防漏纖薄護翼夜用衞生巾30cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樂而雅Laurier 零感特薄衞生巾35cm—薰衣草香\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114529323454464860217.jpeg/8LJtf8mUH-IXIXHRHSVZ9m-nxArIlP9_Dxl8pw8ZfKc\"/><figcaption>樂而雅Laurier 零感特薄衞生巾35cm—薰衣草香</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高潔絲Kotex 草本極緻綿柔纖巧超長夜用衞生巾35cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114532242821120681750.jpeg/xLEbibEtBjUkgmdSLn4gX52xycj-re7Hnyd2i58ndos\"/><figcaption>高潔絲Kotex 草本極緻綿柔纖巧超長夜用衞生巾35cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"樂而雅Laurier 清爽超瞬吸棉柔夜用有護翼衛生巾30cm (孖裝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114535011192832237549.jpeg/ckGVr9qsmhFWmwuT_DwcEc9yLr8KGr77kkhS-5JIUvs\"/><figcaption>樂而雅Laurier 清爽超瞬吸棉柔夜用有護翼衛生巾30cm (孖裝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"護舒寶Whisper 甜睡瞬潔夜用量多衞生巾32cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114537985085440890427.jpeg/KKPJIsUcfoDnUta65MZQxtDiDnpw1rxJgDOB74Azge8\"/><figcaption>護舒寶Whisper 甜睡瞬潔夜用量多衞生巾32cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高潔絲Kotex 益菌平衡極薄日/夜用衞生巾28cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114541089001472691504.jpeg/-Md47_1yApzN74GWt58iFvlRmi1Q1wkB6MEmS-jBJks\"/><figcaption>高潔絲Kotex 益菌平衡極薄日/夜用衞生巾28cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Mannings Guardian 極緻守護超薄日/夜用衛生巾 Ultra Protect  Ultra Thin Napkin 29cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114528023220224241978.jpeg/NMw2bmZRPtYFXDz5d0u0yMnzxNhXCO55Q-24WkPtuFo\"/><figcaption>Mannings Guardian 極緻守護超薄日/夜用衛生巾 Ultra Protect  Ultra Thin Napkin 29cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紅豆蜜語Organicseed 特抗菌防敏感純天然無添加植物配方多流 量日用夜用衛生巾29cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114531093581824576309.jpeg/NaHOFsl_oLsLT556zBuJYnNcrZv79oZQMmy4AjJsuAI\"/><figcaption>紅豆蜜語Organicseed 特抗菌防敏感純天然無添加植物配方多流 量日用夜用衛生巾29cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"怡爽So Nice 特長日用夜用衞生巾28.5cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114534054891520087163.jpeg/567b2gtuGWIEzHM7XsgHNyrKPnATenq2yjUXHso1Fx4\"/><figcaption>怡爽So Nice 特長日用夜用衞生巾28.5cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"護舒寶Whisper Air Cushion秒吸抗黏極薄氣墊衞生棉/巾 Air Cushion Ultra Pad 28cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114536861011968637098.jpeg/l9PjoJb5fhumP1PydJo3YdrglzAV5t5q_f4Yy_3-GMs\"/><figcaption>護舒寶Whisper Air Cushion秒吸抗黏極薄氣墊衞生棉/巾 Air Cushion Ultra Pad 28cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Kleannara 有機純棉衞生巾26cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114539935567872176058.jpeg/Q2q2iy3xGYEBjEp7N7J-ef7Rm4pteK19KclUsCnJVLA\"/><figcaption>Kleannara 有機純棉衞生巾26cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"護舒寶Whisper Air-Dry雲枕瞬吸量大衞生巾28cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114527574429696024695.jpeg/aM6hBi1lHcsa975zvhXwDgvbzD9Dyq4NsJ4VY7CeFWM\"/><figcaption>護舒寶Whisper Air-Dry雲枕瞬吸量大衞生巾28cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tsuno Super Pads 290mm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114530770620416705438.jpeg/y_TqCk0ghB3yM8SCK9zerMJNycYLwpuHVQgiKVUIIik\"/><figcaption>Tsuno Super Pads 290mm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高潔絲Kotex 益菌平衡極薄日/夜用衞生巾28cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114533639655424356784.jpeg/BCE-wkinqWT8rvnh5HKHiTPIk4J4twpeujBNbbowTW0\"/><figcaption>高潔絲Kotex 益菌平衡極薄日/夜用衞生巾28cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Elis 素肌超柔日用衞生巾27cm (優惠孖裝)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114536361889792941703.jpeg/ZGF7v7bGuT1Uf_1DWfRMqVdFJkjOxeK5gOBibYDgYm0\"/><figcaption>Elis 素肌超柔日用衞生巾27cm (優惠孖裝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Chericot Organic Cotton Sanitary Pads 29cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114539260284928928157.jpeg/ylEf_LKQJ36sv9GTO7v4DsMNnCGbgDUxHYBhSx2AYUs\"/><figcaption>Chericot Organic Cotton Sanitary Pads 29cm</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蘇菲Sofy Center-in 棉柔衛生巾護翼夜用29cm\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260914/1176114413816516608564780.jpeg/GlQifU_FskWeFXvpGo1g1mTdBKxGsO74e9PgzHvT4Mw\"/><figcaption>蘇菲Sofy Center-in 棉柔衛生巾護翼夜用29cm</figcaption></figure><p>LadiM吸收速度需73秒最長</p><p>吸收能力較差的樣本是LadiM的石墨烯衞生巾日用，長度為24.5厘米，每片平均零售價約3.17元。測試發現，其吸收速度需73秒，整體評分僅3分。</p><p>至於表現較佳的款式，每片1.85元的Elis素肌超柔日用衞生巾（優惠孖裝），長度27厘米，吸收速度4秒，整體評分達5分；另外，售價最便宜的26厘米Kleannara有機純棉衞生巾，每片約1.01元，吸收速度達10秒，整體評分達5分滿分。</p><p>夜用衞生巾方面，較理想的產品則包括樂而雅Laurier清爽超瞬吸棉柔夜用有護翼衞生巾，長為30厘米，每片價錢約1.94元，吸收速度僅3秒，整體評分達4.5高分；高潔絲Kotex安心熟睡超薄熟睡夜用衞生巾，長度41厘米，每片約5.13元，吸收速度同樣3秒，整體評分達5分滿分。</p><p>此外，消委會進行化學及微生物測試，發現所有樣本均沒有檢出不合規格的微生物及物質，表現理想。</p><p>「Kotex」品牌商表示，消委會的吸收速度測試中，所使用的液體總量或高於普遍女性經期時每次平均流量，認為上述測試結果僅反映特定實驗室條件下的表現，未能完整呈現產品於實際使用時的整體效能與感受，又指其產品嚴格遵循相關標準並取得國際品質認證。</p><p>「LadiM」總代理商向消委會提交其生產商發出的廠檢測試報告，顯示其產品符合GB/T 8939-2018標準的要求，包括吸收速度、全長偏差等項目。</p><p>「Dear Skin」總代理認為其產品吸收速度測試結果達到5秒，且通過微生物檢測，證實了「NO SAP無化學吸水物料」在安全和衞生上的卓越表現。「Mannings Guardian」分銷商指其產品符合該公司的質量和安全要求。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T02:38:47.331466+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2503,"images":37,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none"}}